	(text "Auxiliary power"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 20 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 2.54 2.54)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "22ec46fe-9d86-4fba-8c23-cf846616ed67")
	)
	(text "SPEC.md 11.2b - DECISIONS.md D020. HV flyback (INN3990CQ) -> 15 V main rail; LM5175 buck-boost from 12-24 V AUX_IN OR'd in via LM74610 smart diode; LMR51430 bucks -> 5 V / 12 V; TLV1117 -> 3.3 V; 4x SN6505B+750316856 gate supplies; NXE2S0505MC CAN 5 V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 24.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fbdcaacb-da53-4b2a-b3dd-c44b5b695261")
	)
	(text "ISOLATION: primary side of T601 floats at HV bus potential (48-450 V, 500 V transient).\nSpacing per SPEC 10: >=3.2 mm clearance / >=6.4 mm creepage power->control, T601 reinforced >=4 kV.\nFluxLink feedback is internal to U601 (no optocoupler). Film caps C601/C602 in series so no single\npart spans the full bus (SPEC 8.2). Optional CM choke placeholder: fit 2x wire links / CMC [TBV]\nin the DC_BUS_P/N feed if conducted emissions require it - not placed as a part."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 132.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "93bb7b5c-778f-4fac-9b0e-086275ebf5ef")
	)
	(text "SR pin tied to GND: diode-only rectification (datasheet:\n'If no SR FET is used connect this pin to GND').\nIS tied to GND: no CC regulation.\nFB divider 143k/13.2k @ 1.265 V ref -> 14.97 V.\nFeed-forward 10k + 10 nF per Fig 10."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 57.15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d77e833b-c02c-4686-a40e-195cfab892d1")
	)
	(text "D604 SS54: plain Schottky OR from flyback into AUX_15V.\nPenalty ~0.4 V / ~0.7 W at 1.7 A. Upgrade: second\nLM74610+FET stage [TBV]. Flyback is the primary source;\nthe LM5175 aux path carries the board only when the\n12-24 V feed is present (15.02 V > 14.97 - 0.4 V)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 71.12 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "da4cdfb8-d068-4c56-a816-11146a3b5ffc")
	)
	(text "Primary OVP chain (not fitted - note per datasheet):\nzener + series R + blocking diode from the rectified\nbias rail into BPP triggers latching OVP at ISD.\nFit if secondary OVP insufficient [TBV]."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 200.66 83.82 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "1460a59a-f7ac-4824-92ef-bbdbbcc8a4be")
	)
	(text "AUX input: LM5175 4-switch buck-boost, 12-24 V in -> 15.02 V (FB 88.7k/4.99k @ 0.8 V).\nfsw 300 kHz (RT 84.5k), CCM+hiccup (MODE 93.1k), all loop/support values [TBV].\nEN divider 100k/16.2k -> input UVLO ~8.9 V [TBV]. ISNS+/- shorted (CC loop disabled)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 262.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "63d8daf6-a339-47c0-bfed-c1a91410abb2")
	)
	(text "Gate-drive supplies (x4): SN6505B push-pull from +5V (SN6505B is 5 V-only, D020) + WE 750316856\n(1:4.67 CT:CT) -> 22-25 V raw full-wave rail (VGD_x_RAW). MM3Z4V7ST1G zener from raw(-) sets COM\n4.7 V above it, so COM-N = -4.7 V; the +15 V leg is then POST-REGULATED per D026 (see the note at\nthe left of this sheet) because the raw 20.3 V broke the module's +19 V AMR. Transformer isolation\nis functional (2.5 kVac); the reinforced barrier remains in the 1ED3491 drivers (SPEC 5, D017)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 281.94 285.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d2b2822b-9993-4eea-9868-561023e62468")
	)
	(text "+5V / +12V / +3.3V / GND are global power rails sourced on this sheet (PWR_FLAG on +5V here;\n+12V flagged on precharge sheet, +3.3V and GND flagged on MCU sheet - no duplicates)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20 289.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "fd7d2507-3271-42d7-85fd-d68f32ae7f75")
	)
	(text "CAN supply: functional 3 kVDC isolation.\nCAN_GND is the isolated CAN return - do not tie to GND."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 220.98 275.0 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "8879fb9f-7a0b-4578-8651-483cd84c126d")
	)
